OL,3,GNEWSATeen driver jailed for high speed
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage driver who put lives at risk
OL,7,Fduring a police pursuit near children
OL,8,Fwalking to school has been jailed.
OL,10,FLewis Naisbitt reached speeds of 100mph
OL,11,F(161km/h) through London Road,
OL,12,FCarlisle, more than three times the
OL,13,Fspeed limit, and drove through red
OL,14,Flights while near children walking on
OL,15,Fpavements.
OL,17,FCarlisle Crown Court heard the
OL,18,F19-year-old of Sunningdale Road,
OL,19,FMiddlesbrough, was a disqualified
OL,20,Fdriver and had no recollection of the
OL,21,Fincident due to previous consumption of
OL,22,Fpregabalin and cannabis.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
