OL,3,GNEWSATeen driver jailed for high speed
OL,4,Apolice pursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FNaisbitt admitted dangerous driving,
OL,7,Fdisqualified driving, failing to take a
OL,8,Fpreliminary drug test, having no
OL,9,Finsurance and fraudulently using a
OL,10,Fregistration mark. He was jailed for 14
OL,11,Fmonths.
